{"id":"s1.2.6","slug":"double-and-half-trick","title":"Double and Half Trick","content":"<p class=\"mb-4\">This trick involves multiplying by a clever version of 1, specifically $\\frac{2}{2}$. You double one of the numbers in a multiplication problem and halve the other. This is especially useful when one number ends in 5 or is an even number in the teens.</p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mb-4\"><li>$15 \\times 78 = (15 \\times 2) \\times \\frac{78}{2} = 30 \\times 39 = 1170$</li><li>$35 \\times 42 = 70 \\times 21 = 1470$</li><li>$18 \\times 52 = 9 \\times 104 = 936$</li></ul>","summary":"This trick involves multiplying by a clever version of 1, specifically .","generation_guideline":"Generate a multiplication problem where one number is even and the other ends in 5.","questions":[{"id":1,"text":"Calculate $1.5 \\times 5.2$.","answer":"7.8","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":2,"text":"Calculate $4.8 \\times 15$.","answer":"72","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":3,"text":"Calculate $64 \\times 1.5$.","answer":"96","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":4,"text":"Calculate $15 \\times 48$.","answer":"720","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":5,"text":"Calculate $14 \\times 203$.","answer":"2842","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":6,"text":"Calculate $14 \\times 312$.","answer":"4368","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":7,"text":"Calculate $24 \\times 35$.","answer":"840","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":8,"text":"Calculate $312 \\times 14$.","answer":"4368","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":9,"text":"A rectangle has a length of 2.4 and a width of 1.5. Its area is","answer":"3.6","kind":"exact","tags":["geometry"]},{"id":10,"text":"Calculate $18 \\times 112$.","answer":"2016","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":11,"text":"Calculate $27 \\times 14$.","answer":"378","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":12,"text":"Calculate $21 \\times 15 \\times 14$.","answer":"4410","kind":"exact"